From a5f8f0e919347776746820a24b37fa8e6c3c172b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 09:26:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Override 1940D themed brain screen auton selector

Touchscreen LVGL selector with six auton buttons, a side panel showing the
selected auton's description, odom pose in the header, and the pick echoed
to the controller. autonomous() now runs whatever is selected.

Themed from the team logo: black/white/bolt yellow (#F7D246), logo icon and
wordmark converted to LVGL images, and Unbounded Black (closest free match
to the logo lettering) converted to LVGL fonts at 12/16/22px.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KUGeaonTw5opxFfH5nnvBJ
